%. Every other source and his last two seasons are at 88 to 89% on 3.7 FTA.","sources":["stats"]},{"field":"tov","text":"Fantrax projects only 0.6 TO. The other sources say 1.6 to 1.7, and his TOV% has been about 8 for two seasons.","sources":["stats"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"The Pelicans do not own their pick, and there is an active trade market for him. That means a small risk of March rest or caution.","sources":["https://youtu.be/uRsfijpBPok?t=1851","https://youtu.be/sTtFUy7IoJI?t=1577"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}